Social-Liberal Coalition (<span style="color: [+ spd_colour +];">**SPD**</span> + [? if not lvp_formed: <span style="color: [+ ddp_colour +];">**[+ ddp_name +]**</span>?][? if lvp_formed: <span style="color: [+ lvp_colour +];">**LVP**</span>?]): [+ social_liberal_coalition_anhalt +]%

