@anhalt_coalition_menu

- @social_liberal_coalition_anhalt
- @bourgeois_coalition_anhalt
- @thick_bourgeois_coalition_anhalt
- @left_coalition_anhalt
- @spd_majority_anhalt
- @right_wing_coalition_anhalt
- @no_coalition_anhalt
