- @anhalt_toleration_option

@social_liberal_coalition_anhalt
title: A Social-Liberal Coalition will be formed
choose-if: social_liberal_coalition_anhalt >= 50 and ddp_relation >= 25
on-arrival: anhalt_election_2_trigger_time = time + 48; dvp_relation += 2; ddp_relation += 3; anhalt_gov = "Social-Liberal"; anhalt_spd = 1; anhalt_ddp = 1; anhalt_lr = 2

@bourgeois_coalition_anhalt
title: A bourgeois coalition is formed.
subtitle: The moderate bourgeois parties have somehow achieved a majority
choose-if: bourgeois_coalition_anhalt >= 50
view-if: bourgeois_coalition_anhalt < 50
on-arrival: anhalt_election_2_trigger_time = time + 48; anhalt_gov = "Bourgeois"; anhalt_ddp = 1; anhalt_dvp = 1; anhalt_kvp = 1; anhalt_lvp = 1; anhalt_vrp = 1; anhalt_wp = 1; anhalt_true_other = 1; anhalt_farm = 1

@thick_bourgeois_coalition_anhalt
title: A bourgeois united front?
subtitle: The <span style="color: [+ ddp_colour +];">DVP</span> rallys the bourgeois behind itself
choose-if: thick_bourgeois_coalition_anhalt >= 50
view-if: bourgeois_coalition_anhalt < 50 and ddp_relation < 25
on-arrival: anhalt_election_2_trigger_time = time + 48; anhalt_gov = "Bourgeois"; anhalt_ddp = 2; anhalt_dvp = 1; anhalt_dnvp = 2; anhalt_kvp = 2; anhalt_lvp = 1; anhalt_dvfp = 2; anhalt_wp = 2; anhalt_true_other = 2; anhalt_farm = 2

You can't even rely on the <span style="color: [+ ddp_colour +];">DDP</span>...

@left_coalition_anhalt
title: A Coalition of the Left will be formed
subtitle: We will work alongside the KPD
choose-if: left_coalition_anhalt >= 50 and kpd_relation >= 50
on-arrival: anhalt_election_2_trigger_time = time + 48; anhalt_gov = "Left"; anhalt_spd = 1; anhalt_sapd = 1; anhalt_uspd = 1; anhalt_kpd = 1
go-to: final_checkout_anhalt

@spd_majority_anhalt
title: We don't need any coalition partners
view-if: spd_r_anhalt >= 50
on-arrival: anhalt_election_2_trigger_time = time + 48; workers_spd += 1; workers_dnvp -= 2; rural_spd += 1; rural_dnvp -= 1; anhalt_gov = "SPD"; anhalt_spd = 1

@right_wing_coalition_anhalt
title: The Right forms a government.
choose-if: right_coalition_anhalt >= 50
view-if: right_coalition_anhalt >= 50
on-arrival: anhalt_election_2_trigger_time = time + 48; dvp_relation -= 3; anhalt_gov = "Right"; anhalt_dvfp = 2; anhalt_dvp = 1; anhalt_dnvp = 1; anhalt_nsdap = 2; anhalt_wp = 2; anhalt_dvp = 1; anhalt_true_other = 2

This can't end well...

@no_coalition_anhalt
title: There is no possible government arrangement
subtitle: New elections will be called...
on-arrival: anhalt_election_2_trigger_time = time + 6; old_middle_dnvp += 1
view-if: right_coalition_anhalt < 50 and bourgeois_coalition_anhalt < 50 and thick_bourgeois_coalition_anhalt < 50


@anhalt_coalition_creator_option
title: Custom Coalition Creator
subtitle: Why not try to achieve another deal?
on-arrival: anhalt_coalition_r = spd_r_anhalt; anhalt_spd = 1
go-to: anhalt_coalition_creator

@anhalt_coalition_creator
title: Coalition Creator

Current support: [+ anhalt_coalition_r +]%

- @anhalt_invite_kpd: Invite the <span style="color: [+ kpd_colour +];">**KPD**</span>
- @anhalt_invite_sapd: Invite the <span style="color: [+ sapd_colour +];">**SAPD**</span>
- @anhalt_invite_uspd: Invite the <span style="color: [+ uspd_colour +];">**USPD**</span>
- @anhalt_invite_ddp: Invite the <span style="color: [+ ddp_colour +];">**DDP**</span>
- @anhalt_invite_lvp: Invite the <span style="color: [+ lvp_colour +];">**LVP**</span>
- @anhalt_invite_z: Invite the <span style="color: [+ z_colour +];">**Zentrum**</span>
- @anhalt_invite_vhg: Invite the <span style="color: #CEDD8A;">**Land Reform**</span>
- @anhalt_invite_others: Invite the <span style="color: [+ i_colour +];">**Others**</span>
- @anhalt_invite_dvp: Invite the <span style="color: [+ dvp_colour +];">**DVP**</span>
- @anhalt_invite_kvp: Invite the <span style="color: [+ kvp_colour +];">**KVP**</span>
- @anhalt_invite_wp: Invite the <span style="color: #b8996f;">**WP**</span>
- @anhalt_invite_dnvp: Invite the <span style="color: [+ dnvp_colour +];">**DNVP**</span>
- @anhalt_check_out: Check out.
- @anhalt_drop_kpd: Drop the <span style="color: [+ kpd_colour +];">**KPD**</span>
- @anhalt_drop_sapd: Drop the <span style="color: [+ sapd_colour +];">**SAPD**</span>
- @anhalt_drop_uspd: Drop the <span style="color: [+ uspd_colour +];">**USPD**</span>
- @anhalt_drop_ddp: Drop the <span style="color: [+ ddp_colour +];">**DDP**</span>
- @anhalt_drop_lvp: Drop the <span style="color: [+ lvp_colour +];">**LVP**</span>
- @anhalt_drop_z: Drop the <span style="color: [+ z_colour +];">**Zentrum**</span>
- @anhalt_drop_vhg: Drop the <span style="color: #CEDD8A;">**Land Reform**</span>
- @anhalt_drop_others: Drop the <span style="color: [+ i_colour +];">**Others**</span>
- @anhalt_drop_dvp: Drop the <span style="color: [+ dvp_colour +];">**DVP**</span>
- @anhalt_drop_kvp: Drop the <span style="color: [+ kvp_colour +];">**KVP**</span>
- @anhalt_drop_wp: Drop the <span style="color: #b8996f;">**WP**</span>
- @anhalt_call_new_election: We need new elections
- @return_to_anhalt: Return


@anhalt_invite_kpd
view-if: kpd_r_anhalt > 0 and not anhalt_kpd == 1
choose-if: kpd_relation >= 50 and anhalt_dvp == 0 and anhalt_wp == 0 and (not anhalt_z == 1 or z_leader == "Joos" or z_leader == "Kaiser")
subtitle: The <span style="color: [+ kpd_colour +];">**KPD**</span> will demand radical policies.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if  kpd_relation < 50: We need better relations. ?][? if not anhalt_dvp == 0: They are not really pleased about our partners. ?]
on-arrival: anhalt_coalition_r = anhalt_coalition_r + kpd_r_anhalt; anhalt_kpd = 1
go-to: anhalt_coalition_creator

@anhalt_invite_sapd
view-if: sapd_r_anhalt > 0 and not anhalt_sapd == 1
choose-if: sapd_relation >= 50 and anhalt_dvp == 0 and anhalt_wp == 0 and (not anhalt_z == 1 or z_leader == "Joos" or z_leader == "Kaiser")
subtitle: The <span style="color: [+ sapd_colour +];">**SAPD**</span> will demand radical policies.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if  sapd_relation < 50: We need better relations. ?][? if not anhalt_dvp == 0: They are not really pleased about our partners. ?]
on-arrival: anhalt_coalition_r = anhalt_coalition_r + sapd_r_anhalt; anhalt_sapd = 1
go-to: anhalt_coalition_creator

@anhalt_invite_uspd
view-if: uspd_r_anhalt > 0 and not anhalt_uspd == 1
choose-if: uspd_relation >= 40 and anhalt_wp == 0 and (not anhalt_z == 1 or z_leader == "Joos" or z_leader == "Kaiser" or uspd_ideology == "Orthodox Marxism")
subtitle: [? if not uspd_ideology == "Orthodox Marxism": The <span style="color: [+ uspd_colour +];">**USPD**</span> will demand radical policies. ?][? if uspd_ideology == "Orthodox Marxism": Center Marxists are flexible. ?]
on-arrival: anhalt_coalition_r = anhalt_coalition_r + uspd_r_anhalt; anhalt_uspd = 1
go-to: anhalt_coalition_creator

@anhalt_invite_ddp
view-if: ddp_r_anhalt > 0 and not anhalt_ddp == 1
choose-if: ddp_relation >= 30 and (not anhalt_kpd == 1 or kpd_leader == "Conciliators")
subtitle: [? if ddp_relation >= 65: The <span style="color: [+ ddp_colour +];">**DDP**</span> loves you! ?]
on-arrival: anhalt_coalition_r = anhalt_coalition_r + ddp_r_anhalt; anhalt_ddp = 1
go-to: anhalt_coalition_creator

@anhalt_invite_lvp
view-if: lvp_r_anhalt > 0 and not anhalt_lvp == 1
choose-if: lvp_relation >= 35 and (not anhalt_kpd == 1 or kpd_leader == "Conciliators")
subtitle: [? if lvp_relation >= 75: The <span style="color: [+ lvp_colour +];">**LVP**</span> loves you! ?]
on-arrival: anhalt_coalition_r = anhalt_coalition_r + lvp_r_anhalt; anhalt_lvp = 1
go-to: anhalt_coalition_creator

@anhalt_invite_z
view-if: z_r_anhalt > 0 and not anhalt_z == 1
choose-if: z_relation >= 50 and (not anhalt_kpd == 1 or kpd_leader == "Conciliators")
subtitle: The Catholics want pro religous policies.
on-arrival: anhalt_coalition_r = anhalt_coalition_r + z_r_anhalt; anhalt_z = 1
go-to: anhalt_coalition_creator

@anhalt_invite_dvp
view-if: dvp_r_anhalt > 0 and not anhalt_dvp == 1
choose-if: dvp_relation >= 55 and anhalt_kpd == 0 and anhalt_sapd == 0
subtitle: The <span style="color: [+ dvp_colour +];">**DVP**</span> demands tax cuts.
on-arrival: anhalt_coalition_r = anhalt_coalition_r + dvp_r_anhalt; anhalt_dvp = 1
go-to: anhalt_coalition_creator

@anhalt_invite_kvp
view-if: kvp_r_anhalt > 0 and not anhalt_kvp == 1
choose-if: kvp_relation >= 65 and anhalt_kpd == 0 and anhalt_sapd == 0
subtitle: The <span style="color: [+ kvp_colour +];">**KVP**</span> demands opposition to progressive policies.
on-arrival: anhalt_coalition_r = anhalt_coalition_r + kvp_r_anhalt; anhalt_kvp = 1
go-to: anhalt_coalition_creator

@anhalt_invite_vhg
view-if: vhg_r_anhalt > 0 and not anhalt_lr == 1
choose-if: not ideology == "left"
subtitle: The <span style="color: #CEDD8A;">**Georgists**</span> demands steps to a new legal system for land.
on-arrival: anhalt_coalition_r = anhalt_coalition_r + lr_r_anhalt; anhalt_lr = 1
go-to: anhalt_coalition_creator

@anhalt_invite_others
view-if: true_other_r_anhalt > 0 and not anhalt_true_others == 1
choose-if: ddp_relation >= 70 and dvp_relation >= 20
subtitle: The <span style="color: [+ i_colour +];">**Others**</span> are quite diverse.
on-arrival: anhalt_coalition_r = anhalt_coalition_r + true_other_r_anhalt; anhalt_true_others = 1
go-to: anhalt_coalition_creator

@anhalt_invite_wp
view-if: wp_r_anhalt > 0 and not anhalt_wp == 1
choose-if: dvp_relation >= 85 and anhalt_kpd == 0 and anhalt_sapd == 0 and anhalt_uspd == 0
subtitle: The <span style="color: #b8996f;">**WP**</span> is a little conservative and will demand tax cuts.
on-arrival: anhalt_coalition_r = anhalt_coalition_r + wp_r_anhalt; anhalt_wp = 1
go-to: anhalt_coalition_creator

Why did you do this?

@anhalt_invite_dnvp
view-if: dnvp_r_anhalt > 0
choose-if: dnvp_relation >= 900
subtitle: This won't happen.
go-to: anhalt_coalition_creator

Why are you so desperate?

@anhalt_check_out
choose-if: anhalt_coalition_r >= 50
subtitle: We can form a coalition!
unavailable-subtitle: We need more partners
on-arrival: anhalt_gov = "Social-Agrarian" if anhalt_farm == 1; anhalt_gov = "Social-Catholic" if anhalt_z == 1; anhalt_gov = "Weimar" if anhalt_z == 1 and (anhalt_ddp == 1 or anhalt_lvp == 1); anhalt_gov = "Grand" if anhalt_dvp == 1 or anhalt_wp == 1; anhalt_gov = "Left" if anhalt_kpd == 1; anhalt_gov = "Popular-Front" if anhalt_z == 1 and anhalt_kpd == 1; anhalt_gov = "Social-Democratic" if anhalt_uspd == 1 and not anhalt_kpd == 1 and not anhalt_z == 1; anhalt_gov = "Social-Liberal" if (anhalt_ddp == 1 or anhalt_lvp == 1 or anhalt_dvp == 1) and not anhalt_z == 1; anhalt_gov = "Progressive" if (anhalt_uspd == 1 or anhalt_sapd == 1) and (anhalt_ddp == 1 or anhalt_lvp)
go-to: final_checkout_anhalt

Congrats you have formed a [+ anhalt_gov +] Coalition with [+ anhalt_coalition_r +]% parliamentary support!

@anhalt_drop_kpd
view-if: anhalt_kpd == 1
on-arrival: anhalt_coalition_r = anhalt_coalition_r - kpd_r_anhalt; anhalt_kpd = 0
go-to: anhalt_coalition_creator

@anhalt_drop_sapd
view-if: anhalt_sapd == 1
on-arrival: anhalt_coalition_r = anhalt_coalition_r - sapd_r_anhalt; anhalt_sapd = 0
go-to: anhalt_coalition_creator

@anhalt_drop_uspd
view-if: anhalt_uspd == 1
on-arrival: anhalt_coalition_r = anhalt_coalition_r - uspd_r_anhalt; anhalt_uspd = 0
go-to: anhalt_coalition_creator

