@anhalt_drop_others
view-if: anhalt_true_others == 1
on-arrival: anhalt_coalition_r = anhalt_coalition_r - true_other_r_anhalt; anhalt_true_others = 0
go-to: anhalt_coalition_creator

@anhalt_drop_wp
view-if: anhalt_wp == 1
on-arrival: anhalt_coalition_r = anhalt_coalition_r - wp_r_anhalt; anhalt_wp = 0
go-to: anhalt_coalition_creator

It is better that way.

@anhalt_call_new_election
view-if: true_bourgeois_coalition_anhalt < 50
on-arrival: anhalt_election_2_trigger_time = time + 3; new_middle_dnvp += 2; new_middle_ddp -= 1; anhalt_spd = 0

@return_to_anhalt
on-arrival: anhalt_spd = 0; anhalt_kpd = 0; anhalt_sapd = 0; anhalt_uspd = 0; anhalt_ddp = 0; anhalt_lvp = 0; anhalt_dvp = 0; anhalt_kvp = 0; anhalt_vhg = 0; anhalt_true_others = 0; anhalt_wp = 0
go-to: anhalt_coalition_menu

@anhalt_toleration_option
title: Reach a toleration agreement

- @anhalt_tolerate_bourgeois: Tolerate a moderate bourgeois government
- @anhalt_get_toleration: Get other parties to tolerate us

@anhalt_tolerate_bourgeois
on-arrival: anhalt_gov = "Bourgeois"; anhalt_spd = 2; anhalt_ddp = 1; anhalt_dvp = 1; anhalt_true_others = 1; anhalt_farmers = 1; anhalt_lvp = 1; unemployed_spd -= 2; rural_spd -= 1; anhalt_election_2_trigger_time = time + 25

@anhalt_get_toleration
on-arrival: anhalt_coalition_r = spd_r_anhalt; anhalt_spd = 1; anhalt_election_2_trigger_time = time + 29
go-to: anhalt_toleration_menu

If you rely on too many parties you won't be able to maintain your government for that long.

@anhalt_toleration_menu
title: Toleration Menu

Current support: [+ anhalt_coalition_r +]%

- @anhalt_beg_kpd: Ask the <span style="color: [+ kpd_colour +];">**KPD**</span>
- @anhalt_beg_sapd: Ask the <span style="color: [+ sapd_colour +];">**SAPD**</span>
- @anhalt_beg_uspd: Ask the <span style="color: [+ uspd_colour +];">**USPD**</span>
- @anhalt_beg_ddp: Ask the <span style="color: [+ ddp_colour +];">**DDP**</span>
- @anhalt_beg_lvp: Ask the <span style="color: [+ lvp_colour +];">**LVP**</span>
- @anhalt_check_out_toleration: Check out.
- @anhalt_fuck_kpd: Drop the <span style="color: [+ kpd_colour +];">**KPD**</span>
- @anhalt_fuck_sapd: Drop the <span style="color: [+ sapd_colour +];">**SAPD**</span>
- @anhalt_fuck_uspd: Drop the <span style="color: [+ uspd_colour +];">**USPD**</span>
- @anhalt_fuck_ddp: Drop the <span style="color: [+ ddp_colour +];">**DDP**</span>
- @anhalt_fuck_lvp: Drop the <span style="color: [+ lvp_colour +];">**LVP**</span>
- @return_to_anhalt: Return

@anhalt_beg_kpd
view-if: kpd_r_anhalt > 0 and not anhalt_kpd == 2
choose-if: kpd_relation >= 40 or (kpd_relation >= 25 and ideology == "left")
subtitle: The <span style="color: [+ kpd_colour +];">**KPD**</span> will demand radical policies.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if  kpd_relation < 40: We need better relations. ?]
on-arrival: anhalt_coalition_r = anhalt_coalition_r + kpd_r_anhalt; anhalt_kpd = 2; anhalt_election_2_trigger_time -= 5
go-to: anhalt_toleration_menu

@anhalt_beg_sapd
view-if: sapd_r_anhalt > 0 and not anhalt_sapd == 2
choose-if: sapd_relation >= 35 or (sapd_relation >= 30 and ideology == "left")
subtitle: The <span style="color: [+ sapd_colour +];">**SAPD**</span> will demand radical policies.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if  sapd_relation < 35: We need better relations. ?]
on-arrival: anhalt_coalition_r = anhalt_coalition_r + sapd_r_anhalt; anhalt_sapd = 2; anhalt_election_2_trigger_time -= 3
go-to: anhalt_toleration_menu

@anhalt_beg_uspd
view-if: uspd_r_anhalt > 0 and not anhalt_uspd == 2
choose-if: uspd_relation >= 40 or (uspd_relation >= 30 and (uspd_ideology == "Orthodox Marxism" and not ideology == "reformist"))
subtitle: [? if not uspd_ideology == "Orthodox Marxism": The <span style="color: [+ uspd_colour +];">**USPD**</span> will demand radical policies. ?][? if uspd_ideology == "Orthodox Marxism": Center Marxists are flexible. ?]
on-arrival: anhalt_coalition_r = anhalt_coalition_r + uspd_r_anhalt; anhalt_uspd = 2; anhalt_election_2_trigger_time -= 1
go-to: anhalt_toleration_menu

@anhalt_beg_ddp
view-if: ddp_r_anhalt > 0 and not anhalt_ddp == 2
choose-if: ddp_relation >= 30 or (ddp_relation >= 45 and ideology == "left")
subtitle: [? if ddp_relation >= 65: The <span style="color: [+ ddp_colour +];">**DDP**</span> loves you! ?]
on-arrival: anhalt_coalition_r = anhalt_coalition_r + ddp_r_anhalt; anhalt_ddp = 2; anhalt_election_2_trigger_time -= 2
go-to: anhalt_toleration_menu

@anhalt_beg_lvp
view-if: lvp_r_anhalt > 0 and not anhalt_lvp == 1
choose-if: lvp_relation >= 45 or (lvp_relation >= 55 and ideology == "left")
subtitle: [? if lvp_relation >= 75: The <span style="color: [+ lvp_colour +];">**LVP**</span> loves you! ?]
on-arrival: anhalt_coalition_r = anhalt_coalition_r + lvp_r_anhalt; anhalt_lvp = 2; anhalt_election_2_trigger_time -= 4
go-to: anhalt_toleration_menu

@anhalt_check_out_toleration
choose-if: anhalt_coalition_r >= 50
subtitle: We can reach an agreement!
unavailable-subtitle: We need more partners.
on-arrival: anhalt_gov = "SPD"

@anhalt_fuck_kpd
view-if: anhalt_kpd == 2
on-arrival: anhalt_coalition_r = anhalt_coalition_r - kpd_r_anhalt; anhalt_kpd = 0; anhalt_election_2_trigger_time -= 5
go-to: anhalt_toleration_menu

@anhalt_fuck_sapd
view-if: anhalt_sapd == 2
on-arrival: anhalt_coalition_r = anhalt_coalition_r - sapd_r_anhalt; anhalt_sapd = 0; anhalt_election_2_trigger_time -= 3
go-to: anhalt_toleration_menu

@anhalt_fuck_uspd
view-if: anhalt_uspd == 2
on-arrival: anhalt_coalition_r = anhalt_coalition_r - uspd_r_anhalt; anhalt_uspd = 0; anhalt_election_2_trigger_time -= 1
go-to: anhalt_toleration_menu

@anhalt_fuck_ddp
view-if: anhalt_ddp == 2
on-arrival: anhalt_coalition_r = anhalt_coalition_r - ddp_r_anhalt; anhalt_ddp = 0; anhalt_election_2_trigger_time -= 2
go-to: anhalt_toleration_menu

@anhalt_fuck_lvp
view-if: anhalt_lvp == 2
on-arrival: anhalt_coalition_r = anhalt_coalition_r - lvp_r_anhalt; anhalt_lvp = 0; anhalt_election_2_trigger_time -= 4
go-to: anhalt_toleration_menu



@final_checkout_anhalt
title: This title does not matter
on-arrival: workers_kpd += 2  if anhalt_kpd == 1; workers_spd -= 1  if anhalt_kpd == 1



  
